# IWindowLauncher

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`

```csharp
public interface IWindowLauncher : IDisposable
{
    void Show(string url, int width, int height, string title = "Cyréna");
}
```

Cross-platform browser window launcher. Implementations open a new OS-level window (or browser tab) at `url`, sized `width × height`, with `title` as the window title. The default `title` is `"Cyréna"`.

`IDisposable` because launching a window typically ties up browser/multi-window state that must be released when the host disposes.

## Usage

```csharp
public class MyExtension
{
    [KernelInject]
    private IWindowLauncher _launcher { get; set; } = default!;

    public void OpenExternalDocs()
    {
        _launcher.Show("https://docs.example.com", 1024, 768, "External Docs");
    }
}
```

## Related
- `Cyrena.Runtime` / `Cyrena.Shell` — provide platform-specific `IWindowLauncher` implementations
- `KernelComponentBase` — common host for components that need a `IWindowLauncher`
